+// block load = the instruction's a). fq[t nh + h] = scale 2^-e. A key (fp16) times a part is exact in the matrix engine,
+// so a score = (one chain of 3 x 128 exact products) x fq. nlost[0] += values not exact in 3 parts (below 2^-24 after the
